{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a75b3b950e45d68c03c4fb67f398588","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t know where those specific pictures were taken, but as far as privacy goes, we are getting married at Playa Azul, and having our reception there. It is looked a little past Maya Beach, and from what I have read that is the most private spot you can get married. I have also read that Coral Beach is pretty private.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874726,"PostDate":1412779977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I don't know where those specific pictures were taken, but as far as privacy goes, we are getting married at Playa Azul, and having our reception there. It is looked a little past Maya Beach, and from what I have read that is the most private spot you can get married. I have also read that Coral Beach is pretty private.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410923588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b1828e2a808f0c9aa7ab4eea9b7373d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Question for anyone that has checked out the Barcelo in Riviera Maya website lately\u2026I have been checking for two weeks and for some reason the trips and excursion page is in German! I have checked it on my phone, and on two different computers, and even though \"english\" is selected as the language on top, the trips and excursions page ONLY is in German. Has anyone else noticed this, or is it just showing up on my internet connection?? Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874763,"PostDate":1412792112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Question for anyone that has checked out the Barcelo in Riviera Maya website lately\u2026I have been checking for two weeks and for some reason the trips and excursion page is in German! I have checked it on my phone, and on two different computers, and even though \"english\" is selected as the language on top, the trips and excursions page ONLY is in German. Has anyone else noticed this, or is it just showing up on my internet connection?? Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410923588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.252.47.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02ef348c44f12be64d842acbb41e3f63","RawContent":"Hi Ladies,\n\nCongratulations on all your upcoming weddings!!\nYou have all made great choices...in Mexico,The Barcelo and in this forum.\n\nThe Barcelo is an amazing resort with beautiful beaches,crystal tourqoise waters and spectacular sunsets.\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nThis is great information for anyone having a DW  and a beach wedding.[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nPlease click on the below link to review our comprehensive guide,  \"Top tips for WOW beach wedding photos\"[\/font][\/color][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/wedding-tips\/top-tips-for-wow-beach-wedding-photos-by-vincen-r2226\"]http:\/\/www.bestdesti...by-vincen-r2226[\/url][\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]\nHere are some images of a recent wedding we shot at The Barcelo...please let me know if you would like to see more...[\/font][\/color]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17831\/med_gallery_277385_17831_541175.jpg[\/img]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17831\/med_gallery_277385_17831_105749.jpg[\/img]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17831\/med_gallery_277385_17831_154129.jpg[\/img]\n\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]My name is Alexis and i look forward to hearing from you all. Please contact me if you have any queries.[\/font][\/color]\n\nHappy Planning Ladies\n[quote name=\"cfinkenbine\" post=\"1874763\" timestamp=\"1412792112\"]\nQuestion for anyone that has checked out the Barcelo in Riviera Maya website lately\u2026I have been checking for two weeks and for some reason the trips and excursion page is in German! I have checked it on my phone, and on two different computers, and even though \"english\" is selected as the language on top, the trips and excursions page ONLY is in German. Has anyone else noticed this, or is it just showing up on my internet connection?? Thanks![\/quote]Dear cfinkenbine,\n\nI see that too. Its wierd because parts oft he page is in english but the information about each tour is in German. \nIf you have a wedding planner at the Barcelo they might be able to help you out.\n\nRegards\nAlexis","Attachments":[],"Id":1874776,"PostDate":1412795114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations on all your upcoming weddings!!<\/p>\n<p>You have all made great choices...in Mexico,The Barcelo and in this forum.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The Barcelo is an amazing resort with beautiful beaches,crystal tourqoise waters and spectacular sunsets.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">This is great information for anyone having a DW \u00a0and a beach wedding.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Please click on the below link to review our comprehensive guide, \u00a0\"Top tips for WOW beach wedding photos\"<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/wedding-tips\/top-tips-for-wow-beach-wedding-photos-by-vincen-r2226' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...by-vincen-r2226<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Here are some images of a recent wedding we shot at The Barcelo...please let me know if you would like to see more...<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17831\/med_gallery_277385_17831_541175.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_277385_17831_541175.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17831\/med_gallery_277385_17831_105749.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_277385_17831_105749.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17831\/med_gallery_277385_17831_154129.jpg\" alt=\"med_gallery_277385_17831_154129.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">My name is Alexis and i look forward to hearing from you all. Please contact me if you have any queries.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning Ladies<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>cfinkenbine, on 08 October 2014 - 10:15 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Question for anyone that has checked out the Barcelo in Riviera Maya website lately\u2026I have been checking for two weeks and for some reason the trips and excursion page is in German! I have checked it on my phone, and on two different computers, and even though \"english\" is selected as the language on top, the trips and excursions page ONLY is in German. Has anyone else noticed this, or is it just showing up on my internet connection?? Thanks!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Dear cfinkenbine,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I see that too. Its wierd because parts oft he page is in english but the information about each tour is in German.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have a wedding planner at the Barcelo they might be able to help you out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Regards<\/p>\n<p>Alexis<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"georgina@pixanphoto.com","IpAddress":"201.166.29.36","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1398731802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277766.jpg?_r=1411686578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PixanPhotography","Id":277766,"Name":"PixanPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cebd489e679a6a9079e47723935f4d63","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Well I am glad I am not the only one it is showing up in German for! I was just waiting to see when it would change back to normal\u2026but it has been at least two weeks so I guess I might have to e-mail somebody!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874782,"PostDate":1412800512,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Well I am glad I am not the only one it is showing up in German for! I was just waiting to see when it would change back to normal\u2026but it has been at least two weeks so I guess I might have to e-mail somebody!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410923588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.157.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c794542c0fd1cc67f72adbd5d50e92ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Having been to the Barcelo now, the beach that you can get the MOST privacy at is Playa Azul and it actually has the nicest beach and water (in my opinion). The beach in front of the Tropical and Palace has lots of rock etc, so if you like that then its good, but I like the look of all sand into teal blue water which is Playa Azul. It is slightly removed from the resort too so you dont have all the same passerby&#039;s like you would at the other locations. The only thing is there is not a lot of tree coverage, so it can get hot!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874951,"PostDate":1412878654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Having been to the Barcelo now, the beach that you can get the MOST privacy at is Playa Azul and it actually has the nicest beach and water (in my opinion). The beach in front of the Tropical and Palace has lots of rock etc, so if you like that then its good, but I like the look of all sand into teal blue water which is Playa Azul. It is slightly removed from the resort too so you dont have all the same passerby's like you would at the other locations. The only thing is there is not a lot of tree coverage, so it can get hot!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412130898,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78ec130dbcb017b09a466de95c5a9d73","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you for the info Comet! Glad I chose Playa Azul!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875037,"PostDate":1412905056,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you for the info Comet! Glad I chose Playa Azul!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410923588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.40.138.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc3ecc41dcbe44533f0e5ca4c0be8dd8","RawContent":"I am getting Married November 2015 at Barcelo. We are just in the beginning stages of planning, and from what I noticed from all the other brides I probably should have started a year ago! Makes me nervous to say the least! \n\nI had originally booked the blueberry dream package, but in hind site I decided to upgrade to the mint breeze. (I am still waiting for a response from the WC of this is allowed). I have a few things I&#039;m hoping you guys could help me out with...\n\nHas anyone ever brought thier own officiant?\n\nHave most people brought their own decorations?\n\nHas anyone used a cigar roller at thier reception? Was it worth it?\n\nReviews on outside photographers... Del Sol or Ivan Luckie?\n\nThanks for your help!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897871,"PostDate":1433390120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting Married November 2015 at Barcelo. We are just in the beginning stages of planning, and from what I noticed from all the other brides I probably should have started a year ago! Makes me nervous to say the least! <br>\nI had originally booked the blueberry dream package, but in hind site I decided to upgrade to the mint breeze. (I am still waiting for a response from the WC of this is allowed). I have a few things I'm hoping you guys could help me out with...<br>\nHas anyone ever brought thier own officiant?<br>\nHave most people brought their own decorations?<br>\nHas anyone used a cigar roller at thier reception? Was it worth it?<br>\nReviews on outside photographers... Del Sol or Ivan Luckie?<br>\nThanks for your help!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"girardwedding2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.40.138.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433383839,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"AGirard","Id":283374,"Name":"AGirard","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"146.115.9.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77947,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f2155daf2ad29c7042af50206cd5a10","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am in the process of planning my wedding at the Barcelo Maya Palace on 5\/12\/16 and I wanted to reach out to all who are also in the planning process.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One of the biggest things that can cause the most stress is finding a photographer, and I was lucky enough to have another bride share her tips with me, so I figured I would pay it forward and do the same. Although the wedding is still a few months away, I would recommend Octavio Montes to anyone who is looking for themselves. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was originally just doing google searches, and was only coming up with really expensive photographers, so when I saw this recommendation I was really excited to check it out. Not only is this one of the most affordable options, it is actually cheaper than using the Barcelo photographer even with having to pay the $500 resort fee.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I keep hearing that my wedding day will fly by, so I feel extremely relieved to know that we have all of our special moments ready to be captured!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning to all!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909575,"PostDate":1452892295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Brides!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am in the process of planning my wedding at the Barcelo Maya Palace on 5\/12\/16 and I wanted to reach out to all who are also in the planning process.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>One of the biggest things that can cause the most stress is finding a photographer, and I was lucky enough to have another bride share her tips with me, so I figured I would pay it forward and do the same. Although the wedding is still a few months away, I would recommend Octavio Montes to anyone who is looking for themselves. <a href='http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was originally just doing google searches, and was only coming up with really expensive photographers, so when I saw this recommendation I was really excited to check it out. Not only is this one of the most affordable options, it is actually cheaper than using the Barcelo photographer even with having to pay the $500 resort fee.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I keep hearing that my wedding day will fly by, so I feel extremely relieved to know that we have all of our special moments ready to be captured!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning to all!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.buonincontri25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"146.115.9.226","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428593440,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282687.jpg?_r=1452785388","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashbuoni","Id":282687,"Name":"ashbuoni","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":18,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
