rs","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3681037ce5e179e0f300cbd8fcafc53c","RawContent":"We are going to the same place for my daughters wedding. It will be May 2007.\n I have read so much info on the web but I looked forever to try and find pics of the actual ceremony locations that we have to choose from. Do you know of any wedding pics on the web for that resort showing the actual sites? How did you find the wedding co-ordinators with returning emails and info? I would love to see your wedding photos when you return and any info that will help us. I am going to give my daughter this forum site as I think she will love it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1776,"PostDate":1159433198,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are going to the same place for my daughters wedding. It will be May 2007.<br \/> I have read so much info on the web but I looked forever to try and find pics of the actual ceremony locations that we have to choose from. Do you know of any wedding pics on the web for that resort showing the actual sites? How did you find the wedding co-ordinators with returning emails and info? I would love to see your wedding photos when you return and any info that will help us. I am going to give my daughter this forum site as I think she will love it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ruth.stenson@xplornet.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1159417276,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206836.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"summertime","Id":206836,"Name":"summertime","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c3ebdfaf3d3e81b8c6afda341768de2","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;summertime&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt; I am going to give my daughter this forum site as I think she will love it!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n ruth, if you go to your &amp;quot;usercp&amp;quot;, there is a place to invite guests and you can do it and get credit for the referral...we are having a referral contest right now. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1777,"PostDate":1159435398,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>summertime<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\"> I am going to give my daughter this forum site as I think she will love it!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> ruth, if you go to your \"usercp\", there is a place to invite guests and you can do it and get credit for the referral...we are having a referral contest right now. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/jiggy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Jiggy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1767c95121a9c6a89ffe96b15a798e48","RawContent":"&lt;strong&gt;WEDDINGS &lt;\/strong&gt;\n \n More and more couples are deciding to enjoy the extraordinary experience of getting married in the Caribbean. Our hotel is equipped to host the perfect wedding, catering for your every need: floral decoration in the location, bouquet for the bride and buttonhole for the groom, wedding cake, live music, etc.\n \n Thanks to its location and facilities, Gran Bah\u00ada Pr\u00adncipe Akumal is the ideal setting for an unforgettable honeymoon; the hotel offers newlyweds a basket of tropical fruit, a bottle of tequila and special attention.\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Wedding Package:&lt;\/strong&gt;\n \n contact the wedding coordinator on + 52 984 8755000 (extension 28121), Fax: + 52 984 8755004; e-mail: &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/wedding_forum\/imagehosting\/thum_5024550d6cc684d3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Link to Bahia Principe Akumal Home page:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bahia-principe.com\/bp\/hoteles\/akumal_informacion.jsp\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bahia-principe.com\/bp\/hot...nformacion.jsp&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n \n Link to Bahia Principe Akumal wedding page:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bahia-principe.com\/bp\/hoteles\/akumal_bodas.jsp\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bahia-principe.com\/bp\/hot...umal_bodas.jsp&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":6336,"PostDate":1162943897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <strong>WEDDINGS <\/strong><br \/> <br \/> More and more couples are deciding to enjoy the extraordinary experience of getting married in the Caribbean. Our hotel is equipped to host the perfect wedding, catering for your every need: floral decoration in the location, bouquet for the bride and buttonhole for the groom, wedding cake, live music, etc.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks to its location and facilities, Gran Bah\u00ada Pr\u00adncipe Akumal is the ideal setting for an unforgettable honeymoon; the hotel offers newlyweds a basket of tropical fruit, a bottle of tequila and special attention.<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Wedding Package:<\/strong><br \/> <br \/> contact the wedding coordinator on + 52 984 8755000 (extension 28121), Fax: + 52 984 8755004; e-mail: <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/wedding_forum\/imagehosting\/thum_5024550d6cc684d3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> Link to Bahia Principe Akumal Home page:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.bahia-principe.com\/bp\/hoteles\/akumal_informacion.jsp' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bahia-pri....nformacion.jsp<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Link to Bahia Principe Akumal wedding page:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.bahia-principe.com\/bp\/hoteles\/akumal_bodas.jsp' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bahia-pri....umal_bodas.jsp<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My Dreams Cabo Wedding Review<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t22576\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t22576<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Ryjaxs19@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1159324980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206835.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jackie","Id":206835,"Name":"Jackie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"