"Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1340,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92f893fee5a46d31ea41d7c2d10dd50f","RawContent":"Acapulco Hotels\/Resorts At-a-Glance\n \n Someone gave me this travel brochure for Mexico, and in it there are pages that show some of the hotels\/resorts in different areas and the amenities in a grid. It was handy for me to see it laid out like this - so I thought I&#039;d share. I will also be posting for a bunch of different areas ... stay tuned!\n \n The brochure also rates and gives a little more info. on each hotel\/resort mentioned. If anyone&#039;s interested in more - let me know!\n \n (It was also a good excuse to play with the fun new printer\/scanner we just bought!)","Attachments":[],"Id":16555,"PostDate":1168646925,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Acapulco Hotels\/Resorts At-a-Glance<br \/> <br \/> Someone gave me this travel brochure for Mexico, and in it there are pages that show some of the hotels\/resorts in different areas and the amenities in a grid. It was handy for me to see it laid out like this - so I thought I'd share. I will also be posting for a bunch of different areas ... stay tuned!<br \/> <br \/> The brochure also rates and gives a little more info. on each hotel\/resort mentioned. If anyone's interested in more - let me know!<br \/> <br \/> (It was also a good excuse to play with the fun new printer\/scanner we just bought!)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161392880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":1340,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1d1464e3f30087eb12ff85666a27c39","RawContent":"Ann i think the brochure is missing....","Attachments":[],"Id":165066,"PostDate":1199956992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ann i t