> User Echofaye (285927)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b07ab4ca88565f7bf9730397e625dab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Well I am glad I am not along on this. I am from Canada and have contacted quite a few TA&#039;s and they said they could not get me a firm number as of yet because the pricing isn&#039;t out yet. I am trying to book for Mid - Late April of 2015. I am getting a lot of pressure from guests asking when and how much? so frustrating when I can&#039;t get this information from any TA. I thought I would be able to get something now but I guess I have to wait it out. My only concern is by the time I book out time to travel, that the actually wedding date wouldn&#039;t be available at the resort?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am glad this thread started because I am having trouble and stressing out just a little..lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840126,"PostDate":1395698421,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Well I am glad I am not along on this. I am from Canada and have contacted quite a few TA's and they said they could not get me a firm number as of yet because the pricing isn't out yet. I am trying to book for Mid - Late April of 2015. I am getting a lot of pressure from guests asking when and how much? so frustrating when I can't get this information from any TA. I thought I would be able to get something now but I guess I have to wait it out. My only concern is by the time I book out time to travel, that the actually wedding date wouldn't be available at the resort?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am glad this thread started because I am having trouble and stressing out just a little..lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395346614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.68.224.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"352cccb87e0327b12f9e52ff67be2d1a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am in the exact same boat! I have to go on NS March Break due to work, I know it will be a bit more expensive...So far no pricing seems to be available... I am also worried about missing out on good dates, booking with a higher rate, etc. SIGH&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840195,"PostDate":1395704946,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am in the exact same boat! I have to go on NS March Break due to work, I know it will be a bit more expensive...So far no pricing seems to be available... I am also worried about missing out on good dates, booking with a higher rate, etc. SIGH<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephaniefage@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.68.224.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395704597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Canada2015Bride","Id":277317,"Name":"Canada2015Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.99.194.189","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d85ac34c0f332eaed488dbd7b7c165d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Canada2015Bride,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you gotten any resorts narrowed down? were you able to get any pricing at all?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840274,"PostDate":1395710804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Canada2015Bride,<\/p>\n<p>Have you gotten any resorts narrowed down? were you able to get any pricing at all?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395346614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2de73cdc022002c0b6d4efffd129daa9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I got a quote for an early-mid April 2015 wedding from a TA using Sun Wing vacations. However, she suggested we wait to get some of the other quotes because they will likely be less - she said that for Air Canada vacations they will only look 325 out from the travel date, and no word from West Jet on their time frame. So as much as I want to make a decision and start planning - it seems like I need to wait a little bit to ensure we are getting good rates!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840471,"PostDate":1395782170,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I got a quote for an early-mid April 2015 wedding from a TA using Sun Wing vacations. However, she suggested we wait to get some of the other quotes because they will likely be less - she said that for Air Canada vacations they will only look 325 out from the travel date, and no word from West Jet on their time frame. So as much as I want to make a decision and start planning - it seems like I need to wait a little bit to ensure we are getting good rates!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katymareneck@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.115.109.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395252295,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"KatyM81","Id":277234,"Name":"KatyM81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.89.160.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09f22d40c7a64de4ea76e0753fca0c8f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I know it&#039;s hard to wait because you want to start planning and booking things,&amp;nbsp;but that&#039;s just how it is in the&amp;nbsp;travel world. Hopefully you won&#039;t have to wait too much longer for pricing. If your guests are giving you a hard time about prices, when, where, etc. just tell them to chill out! You&#039;ll share the info whenever you get it - it&#039;s not like you&#039;re witholding it&amp;nbsp;for the fun of it.&amp;nbsp;They&#039;ve gotta relax! And you should too! Relax and enjoy this time, it goes fast :) Prices and dates will come soon enough, and everything snowballs after that. Have fun girls!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840636,"PostDate":1395845350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I know it's hard to wait because you want to start planning and booking things,\u00a0but that's just how it is in the\u00a0travel world. Hopefully you won't have to wait too much longer for pricing. If your guests are giving you a hard time about prices, when, where, etc. just tell them to chill out! You'll share the info whenever you get it - it's not like you're witholding it\u00a0for the fun of it.\u00a0They've gotta relax! And you should too! Relax and enjoy this time, it goes fast <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Prices and dates will come soon enough, and everything snowballs after that. Have fun girls!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackieshaynewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.64.43.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369770017,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270054.jpg?_r=1391705350","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackshayne0123","Id":270054,"Name":"jackshayne0123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.230.220.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c5613cdca46cba576d154ab6d8fecd4","RawContent":"@[member=\"FutureMrsStone\"] I am in the same boat, looking to book for January 2015...I&#039;m stalking travel prices, they haven&#039;t gone up but down just a bit like you were saying. \n\nWhere are you travelling out of? We&#039;re out of Toronto.","Attachments":[],"Id":1841235,"PostDate":1396119089,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277220\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277220-futuremrsstone\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsStone<\/span><\/a> I am in the same boat, looking to book for January 2015...I'm stalking travel prices, they haven't gone up but down just a bit like you were saying. <br>\nWhere are you travelling out of? We're out of Toronto.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.borges81@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"173.164.74.25","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390244252,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"aborgesbride","Id":276225,"Name":"aborgesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f552e73c5d83a1f919b6a3bcb1f1fa99","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I feel all of your pain ladies! We are getting married March 6 2015 in Punta Cana and can&#039;t get flight info yet. We have pricing for the resort but our guests want to know flight info too, so very frustrating! We are also in the position where we can fly out of Toronto, Buffalo or Detroit, so we have a few options to help with pricing at least!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What travel sites is everyone looking at?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841363,"PostDate":1396225684,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I feel all of your pain ladies! We are getting married March 6 2015 in Punta Cana and can't get flight info yet. We have pricing for the resort but our guests want to know flight info too, so very frustrating! We are also in the position where we can fly out of Toronto, Buffalo or Detroit, so we have a few options to help with pricing at least!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What travel sites is everyone looking at?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_miller_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390772931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kellymiller","Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.99.194.189","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"504d154f8dfb20a83930efeee47f87e6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Have all of you ladies booked your wedding date with the resort before getting the travel times. I am undecided what to do?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841382,"PostDate":1396235874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Have all of you ladies booked your wedding date with the resort before getting the travel times. I am undecided what to do?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395346614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.92.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5d79ea8fe96157e75b4d7c31c29ece8","RawContent":"I booked mine before we had set times, I knew what day it would be but had no idea of the flight times until about a month or two later, it wasn&#039;t a big deal for us, as if was quite a deal of time in advance. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1841414,"PostDate":1396242023,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I booked mine before we had set times, I knew what day it would be but had no idea of the flight times until about a month or two later, it wasn't a big deal for us, as if was quite a deal of time in advance. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britne_johnson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.155.92.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351334524,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261823.jpg?_r=1396239549","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":235,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"britter08","Id":261823,"Name":"britter08","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.70.149.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76528,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbdd4d088577d6a5d32551c4e04129f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks everyone! &amp;nbsp;We&#039;d decided to hold of booking anything until late April when the flight schedule comes out for our 2015 dates. &amp;nbsp;This gave us time to get our Save the Dates out, so people have enough notice to get ready to pay the travel deposit.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will work with a travel agent but I&#039;ll book the wedding date at the hotel myself - as far as I can tell there isn&#039;t any benefit of having the TA book the wedding, most of them will just put you in touch with the Hotel&#039;s wedding coordinator rather then booking it for you anyway. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m going to wait until we book the travel package before I book the wedding with the hotel - I don&#039;t want to pay a deposit to the hotel if I&#039;m not 100% sure it&#039;s the resort we will pick. &amp;nbsp;We want to wait and see the exact pricing per person for the travel package before we decide. &amp;nbsp;Having said that - we are not picky on the date or time during the week we get married, if we were I may do it the other way around.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841495,"PostDate":1396282105,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks everyone! \u00a0We'd decided to hold of booking anything until late April when the flight schedule comes out for our 2015 dates. \u00a0This gave us time to get our Save the Dates out, so people have enough notice to get ready to pay the travel deposit.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will work with a travel agent but I'll book the wedding date at the hotel myself - as far as I can tell there isn't any benefit of having the TA book the wedding, most of them will just put you in touch with the Hotel's wedding coordinator rather then booking it for you anyway. \u00a0I'm going to wait until we book the travel package before I book the wedding with the hotel - I don't want to pay a deposit to the hotel if I'm not 100% sure it's the resort we will pick. \u00a0We want to wait and see the exact pricing per person for the travel package before we decide. \u00a0Having said that - we are not picky on the date or time during the week we get married, if we were I may do it the other way around.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ellenrushton2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.157.52.137","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394091014,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277028.jpg?_r=1406329402","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shawnandellen2015","Id":277028,"Name":"shawnandellen2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":115,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
